     "integrity": "sha512-bo+P+JXpeigtK7SBs9rMM5Z5svGirHIuy1ihhuwWUvV8FWS9K/v3UfDPQU/gNb4fnCh1er8s2TSgil0EXLBIQQ==",
     "shasum": "3ed34efb06f0241422695d597e31b7736037ea93",
     "signatures": [
